{"seq":1,"slug":"lc0133-clone-graph","title":"LeetCode 133 克隆图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-tree-graph/lc0133-clone-graph","wordCount":1050,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-133-克隆图\">LeetCode 133 克隆图</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你无向<strong>连通</strong>图中一个节点的引用，请你返回该图的<strong>深拷贝</strong>（克隆）。</p>\n<p>图中的每个节点都包含它的值 <code>val</code>（<code>int</code>）和其邻居的列表（<code>list[Node]</code>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"class Node {&#10;    val: number&#10;    neighbors: Node[]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Node {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val: number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    neighbors: Node[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>adjList = [[2,4],[1,3],[2,4],[1,3]]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[[2,4],[1,3],[2,4],[1,3]]</code></li>\n<li>解释：图中有 4 个节点。节点 1 的邻居是节点 2 和 4，节点 2 的邻居是节点 1 和 3，以此类推。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>adjList = [[]]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[[]]</code></li>\n<li>解释：输入包含一个空列表。该图仅有一个节点，值为 1，没有邻居。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>adjList = []</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[]</code></li>\n<li>解释：这是个空图，没有任何节点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>节点数不超过 100</li>\n<li>每个节点值 <code>Node.val</code> 都是唯一的，<code>1 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li>无向图是无自环和重边的简单图</li>\n<li>图是连通图，可以从给定节点访问到所有节点</li>\n</ul>\n<p>图的深拷贝意味着创建全新的节点对象，新图和原图之间不共享任何引用。难点在于图可能有环，必须避免无限循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"核心挑战-避免重复克隆\">核心挑战：避免重复克隆</h3><p>图中可能存在环（如节点 A 的邻居是 B，B 的邻居是 A）。如果在克隆过程中遇到已经克隆过的节点，必须使用已有的克隆节点而非重新创建，否则会陷入无限循环或创建多余的副本。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案：</strong> 使用哈希映射 <code>Map&lt;Node, Node&gt;</code> 记录「原节点 → 克隆节点」的对应关系。遇到已克隆的节点时，直接从映射中取出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"bfs-克隆\">BFS 克隆</h3><ol>\n<li>克隆起始节点，放入映射和队列</li>\n<li>从队列中取出节点，遍历其邻居</li>\n<li>对未克隆的邻居创建克隆节点并入队</li>\n<li>将克隆邻居添加到当前克隆节点的邻居列表</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"dfs-克隆\">DFS 克隆</h3><ol>\n<li>如果节点已在映射中，直接返回克隆节点</li>\n<li>创建克隆节点，放入映射</li>\n<li>递归克隆所有邻居</li>\n<li>将克隆邻居添加到当前克隆节点的邻居列表</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>思路</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BFS</td>\n<td>队列 + 映射</td>\n<td>O(V + E)</td>\n<td>O(V)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DFS</td>\n<td>递归 + 映射</td>\n<td>O(V + E)</td>\n<td>O(V)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"节点定义\">节点定义</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class GraphNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  neighbors: GraphNode[];&#10;  constructor(val?: number, neighbors?: GraphNode[]) {&#10;    this.val = val ?? 0;&#10;    this.neighbors = neighbors ?? [];&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GraphNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  neighbors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GraphNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">neighbors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GraphNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.neighbors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neighbors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法一-bfs\">方法一：BFS</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function cloneGraph(node: GraphNode | null): GraphNode | null {&#10;  if (node === null) return null;&#10;&#10;  const cloneMap = new Map&lt;GraphNode, GraphNode&gt;();&#10;  const clone = new GraphNode(node.val);&#10;  cloneMap.set(node, clone);&#10;&#10;  const queue: GraphNode[] = [node];&#10;&#10;  while (queue.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    const current = queue.shift()!;&#10;    const currentClone = cloneMap.get(current)!;&#10;&#10;    for (const neighbor of current.neighbors) {&#10;      if (!cloneMap.has(neighbor)) {&#10;        const neighborClone = new GraphNode(neighbor.val);&#10;        cloneMap.set(neighbor, neighborClone);&#10;        queue.push(neighbor);&#10;      }&#10;      currentClone.neighbors.push(cloneMap.get(neighbor)!);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return clone;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cloneGraph</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GraphNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GraphNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cloneMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GraphNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GraphNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GraphNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.val);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cloneMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node, clone);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> queue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GraphNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [node];</span></span>\n<span class=